OL,3,AAldi boss says some of rivals' loyalty
OL,4,Adiscounts 'dupe' customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAldi's UK boss has accused rival
OL,7,Fsupermarket chains of duping customers
OL,8,Fin some cases with loyalty discounts
OL,9,Fthat start with "unrealistically high
OL,10,Fprices" and then drop.
OL,12,FChief executive Giles Hurley said
OL,13,Fdiscounts are helpful "when they're
OL,14,Freal and when they show realistic
OL,15,Freductions", but hit out at what he
OL,16,Fsaid were unrealistic reductions which
OL,17,F"dupe customers".
OL,19,FAldi is the only major supermarket
OL,20,Fchain that doesn't operate a loyalty
OL,21,Fscheme, which are used by millions of
OL,22,Fshoppers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
