OL,3,AAldi boss says some of rivals' loyalty
OL,4,Adiscounts 'dupe' customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's official competition watchdog
OL,7,Finvestigated supermarkets' loyalty
OL,8,Fpricing schemes in 2024 and concluded
OL,9,Fshoppers "almost always make a genuine
OL,10,Fsaving".
